// Syncthing ignore list for archive/ -- same split as results/.stignore:
// git carries the small analysis outputs, Syncthing carries the bulk raw data.
//
// NOTE: *.pkl is excluded here (unlike in results/.stignore) because the 32
// .pkl files under archive/ were committed before the ignore rules were
// widened, so git already carries them. Syncing them here too would give one
// file two masters.

// --- carried by git, so excluded here ---
.git
.ipynb_checkpoints
.stignore
*.pkl
*.png
*.csv
*.ipynb
*.md
*.json
*.txt
*.tex
*.pdf
*.html
*.py

// --- machine-local, regenerated each run ---
*.log
progress.jsonl
